    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Imagine going so deep in the ocean that there’s no sunlight at all. Recently, a team of Chinese scientists did just that. They rode in a small "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "submarine",
            "ref": "v-submarine"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to explore deep parts of the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Pacific Ocean",
            "zh": "太平洋"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They went down more than 9,500 metres!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Down in the dark, the scientists saw amazing "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "creatures",
            "ref": "v-creature"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". There were "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "clams",
            "zh": "蛤蜊"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", ice-like "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bacteria",
            "zh": "细菌"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and strange worms. These creatures live without sunlight. They get energy from "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "chemicals",
            "ref": "v-chemical"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Before this trip, the deepest-sea animal ever "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "recorded"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " was found at 8,336 metres below the surface. This time, the team went deeper and found more life than anyone had expected. Some creatures had never been seen before."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The submarine is called "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Fendouzhe"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It can carry three people and stay underwater for many hours. “If you "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "look through",
            "ref": "v-look-through"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the window at the bottom of the sea,” said one of the scientists, “you will be amazed!”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
